  "title": "Creamy Cheddar Cheese Soup",
  "description": "This creamy cheese soup is rich and full of flavor from the Cheddar, onions, butter, and chicken broth. Makes a comforting lunch on a brisk day.",
  "authors": [
    "Maureen"
  ],
